      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so im a parent of a 7yo and im kinda struggling with something. there's a lot of talk in the news lately about gender identity and stuff, and i want to make sure i'm handling it right. how can i explain the concept of gender identity to my kid in an age-appropriate way that is actually \"correct\" and helps them understand it properly?",
