      "content": "There is no single \"correct\" explanation because each child is unique and developmental stages matter most.\nThe most helpful approach is age-appropriate honesty, focusing on the idea that people can see inside and be different colors.\nAlways validate their questions and feelings while encouraging you to consult reliable sources or a pediatrician if needed for further support.",
